                      "date": "2024-10-22", "version": "2.0",
                      "heading": "Product Manual - Atlas Platform 2.0",
                      "tags": ["troubleshooting", "setup", "features"]},
        ),
        Document(
            text=("Example Corp announced today the general availability of Atlas 2.0, the "
                  "company's flagship analytics platform.\n\n"
                  "The release brings a redesigned dashboard, real-time analytics, and an "
                  "automation engine that lets teams build workflows in minutes instead of "
                  "days.\n\n"
